# Build context for deploy/Containerfile and deploy/Containerfile.debian (always build from the
# repository root). This is an ALLOWLIST: everything is excluded, then only what the image needs is
# let back in. Secrets (deploy/secrets/, .env files), databases, .git and tests never reach the
# builder, so they cannot leak into a layer or into the build provenance.
*

!app/
!data/foods.json
!data/combos.json
!LICENSE
!requirements.lock

# The handbook stage (filled in by M3; docs/dev/research/08-handbook-site.md §4.7) builds /learn
# from these sources. Its generated output and caches stay out.
!handbook/
handbook/site
handbook/.cache

# Never ship bytecode caches, local databases or editor droppings from a working copy.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.env
**/.DS_Store
